  <wpt lat="32.287775" lon="76.265814"><ele>1950</ele><name>Kareri Village Roadhead Trailhead</name><desc>Roadhead near Kareri village where the foot trail begins along the Nyund stream.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.296433" lon="76.269286"><ele>2283</ele><name>Nyund Nullah Crossing</name><desc>Wooden footbridge and freshwater mountain stream.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.302357" lon="76.275061"><ele>2438</ele><name>Reoti Forest Campsite</name><desc>Midway riverside camping meadow shaded by tall pines and silver firs.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.309397" lon="76.268195"><ele>2650</ele><name>Nyund Boulder Moraine Gorge</name><desc>Challenging rocky gorge ascent.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="32.325030" lon="76.273306"><ele>2964</ele><name>Kareri Lake &amp; Shiva Temple Sanctuary</name><desc>High-altitude shallow glacial lake fed by Minkiani snowmelt, with ancient Shiva temple on the knoll.</desc></wpt>
